   129	Here is the full compact-support check.  Let \(\Sigma\) contain every singular
   130	or component-incidence point needed for the stratification and the unique
   131	correction image.  Put
   132	\[
   133	 \sigma=|\Sigma|,\quad
   134	 R_i=\sum_{p\in\Sigma}r_{i,p},\quad
   135	 A_\Sigma=\sum_{p\in\Sigma}a_p.
   136	\]
