   138	exactly \(R_i\) normalization points, so
   139	\(\chi_c(D_i\setminus\Sigma)=1-R_i\).  The reviewed stratification identity
   140	specializes to
   141	\[
   142	 2(1-R_A)+(1-R_B)=4-5\sigma+A_\Sigma. \tag{3.3}
