   199	There is also no genus-cap contradiction.  Even granting the
   200	custody-conditional floor \(d\ge4\), the nonnegative allocations
   201	\[
   202	 \begin{array}{c|ccc}
   203	 &d&\delta_{p_0}&\delta_\infty+\sum_{q\ne p_0}\delta_q\\ \hline
   204	 \text{S1a}&4&1&2\\
   205	 \text{S1b}&4&3&0
   206	 \end{array}
