   521	### 5.3 Delta budget and the shared point at infinity
   522	
   523	Both survivors obey, with `δ := deg D_br`,
   524	
   525	```text
   526	δ_∞ + δ_aff = (δ − 1)(δ − 2)/2,     δ = 3 + 2g + Σ_∞ ≥ 4,
   527	δ_aff = Σ_{double points} k_p        (S2),
   528	δ_aff = δ_{p_0} + Σ_{other double points} k_p   (S1),
   529	```
   530	
   531	where `k_p ≥ 1` is the contact order of the two smooth branches at `p` and
   532	`δ_{p_0} ≥ 1` is the delta invariant of the singular germ at `p_0`. At the
   533	minimum `δ = 4` the whole affine budget is `3 − δ_∞`. No promoted datum bounds
   534	`δ` from above; consistently with the promoted D1-DEGREE typing (CNA §1.4),
   535	degree payoffs are stated for `d_min`, and Gate TG gives `d_min ≥ 4`.
