   601	**Generation floor.** The images of the `δ = deg D_br` meridians of a generic
   602	line form a connected graph on 5 vertices, so at least 4 distinct transpositions
   603	occur, and `δ ≥ 4` (§4.3). In S1 the cuspidal point contributes only the 3
